# toolbar_slots.pdl - generated by `eden_op <conductor> gen-slots toolbar` (do not hand edit; the harness compares it with a fresh run).
# Rows for the taskbar's pdl-driven menu reader (livedesk_pdl_menu_rows): SECTION | <prefix>_menu_<N>_label | text  and  SECTION | <prefix>_menu_<N>_cmd | command.
# Each cmd is a bare shell string (no single quote: the taskbar wraps it in sh -c '...'); ' .' is replaced by the house root by the taskbar, so it runs from any cwd.
# 10 blocks x (header + 10 Save + 10 Load) = 210 rows + cancel. See eden/README.md for what the taskbar needs.
